            "review_title": "Review at C.Tao Chinese Restaurant - Metropole",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n26\nModern Cantonese in Thủ Thiêm, Thủ Đức City\nSep 2024 • Solo\nThis modern Cantonese restaurant is 10 minutes walk from where I am staying in Thu Thiem …. It was a very pleasant surprise. The menu while distinctively based on HK cuisine also delves into dishes from regional China too. There is something for everyone.\n\nI was impressed by the huge range of Dumplings and made a note to come back here one day with a group of people so we could just eat lots of dumplings. I loved the Shanghai Soup Dumplings that I ordered as my entree. It was perfect.\n\nMy next dish the Macau Style Roast Pork Belly was also simply delicious, the skin a perfect crispiness the meat tender and melt in your mouth full of flavour. The second main dishI had was the Crispy fried Prawn with Hong Kong Salt. Again on the whole very tasty. The Yangzhou Fried rice was a good match to both main dishes.\n\nThe only thing i found very ordinary was the flan cake for dessert. \n\nThe service was prompt and friendly and the waiters had enough basic English to make the ordering experience effortless. I only ate here by myself so was limited to what I could taste. I think this would be a great location for a big group lunch.\nRead more\nWritten September 7, 2024",
